Package: missingHE
Type: Package
Title: Missing Cost Effectiveness Models 
Version: 1.6.3
Description: Performs Bayesian cost-effectiveness analysis with missing outcome data. Three classes of models can be fitted under a variety of missing data assumptions: selection models, pattern mixture models and hurdle models. The package allows to assess model convergence and summarise the statistical and economic results using different types of measures and graphs.
